{"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"items","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/Item","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDynamicsV4ItemO","text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"] = [], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"position","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPosition","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLPositionV","text":"MXLPosition","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = MXLPosition(), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"font","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLFont","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLFontV","text":"MXLFont","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = MXLFont(), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","text":"MXLColor","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"halign","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLeftCenterRight","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLLeftCenterRightO","text":"MXLLeftCenterRight","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"valign","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLValign","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLValignO","text":"MXLValign","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"placement","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAboveBelow","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLAboveBelowO","text":"MXLAboveBelow","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"underline","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNumberOfLines","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL16MXLNumberOfLinesV","text":"MXLNumberOfLines","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"overline","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNumberOfLines","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL16MXLNumberOfLinesV","text":"MXLNumberOfLines","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lineThrough","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNumberOfLines","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL16MXLNumberOfLinesV","text":"MXLNumberOfLines","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enclosure","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLEnclosureShape","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL17MXLEnclosureShapeO","text":"MXLEnclosureShape","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil)","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The optional-unique-id attribute group allows an element to optionally specify an ID that is unique to the entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id attribute, or for an id attribute that specifies an id reference.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"id"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One of the alternatives for Dynamics.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"items"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For most elements, any program will compute a default x and y position. The position attributes let this be changed two ways.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"position"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The font attribute group gathers together attributes for determining the font within a credit or direction. They are based on the text styles for Cascading Style Sheets. The font-family is a comma-separated list of font names.The font-style can be normal or italic. The font-size can be one of the CSS sizes or a numeric point size. The font-weight can be normal or bold. The default is application-dependent, but is a text font vs. a music font.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"font"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"color"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In cases where text extends over more than one line, horizontal alignment and justify values can be different. The most typical case is for credits, such as:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"halign"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The valign attribute is used to indicate vertical alignment to the top, middle, bottom, or baseline of the text. Defaults are implementation-dependent.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"valign"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The placement attribute indicates whether something is above or below another element, such as a note or a notation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"placement"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The number of lines used to underline the text: ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (none), ","type":"text"},{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"2","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"code":"3","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"underline"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The number of lines used to overline the text: ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (none), ","type":"text"},{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"2","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"code":"3","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"overline"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The number of lines used to strike through the text: ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (none), ","type":"text"},{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"2","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"code":"3","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"lineThrough"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The enclosure attribute group is used to specify the formatting of an enclosure around text or symbols.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"enclosure"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDynamicsV2id5items8position4font5color6halign6valign9placement9underline8overline11lineThrough9enclosureACSSSg_SayAC4ItemOGAA11MXLPositionVAA7MXLFontVAA8MXLColorVSgAA18MXLLeftCenterRightOSgAA9MXLValignOSgAA13MXLAboveBelowOSgAA16MXLNumberOfLinesVSgA10_A10_AA17MXLEnclosureShapeOSgtcfc","symbolKind":"init","title":"init(id:items:position:font:color:halign:valign:placement:underline:overline:lineThrough:enclosure:)","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Initializer","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"items","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDynamicsV4ItemO","text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"position","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIden